      "writtenOn": "2023-04-13T07:47:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a code smell. In particular, you\u0027re mocking some methods on the spy while this is overriding other methods, and that makes things really difficult to follow. Normally you should not mix spies and mocks, especially not when you control the spied class, but even less when it\u0027s defined right here. Just override the method you need to have it behave like you want instead of using a mix of overrides and Mockito.doReturn.\n\nISTM you want to check that methods are called in order. TrackRecord is a tool we developed for the purposes of doing this and will let you do make much finer checks and offer a lot of useful tooling. You should have a custom class embarking an ArrayTrackRecord like we have in other places in our code when we need to check this kind of thing.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 213,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 213,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "5791473b074d9b4be1223e57e621f816e1cd6cbd",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
