      "writtenOn": "2023-04-13T07:47:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Also consider removing this field and instead having a TrackRecord for the handler events. That will let you not only see the last auto KI in a thread-safe way, but also query all the previous auto KIs which would let you write tests with multiple auto KIs. You\u0027ll also make things a lot easier to write by obviating the need for knowing when to wait for the handler.",
